# Train Invite 2026 / MORGOTH® — Project Rules (THIS FOLDER ONLY)

## What this is
This project is **art / a practical joke**, not a product. It is a purposeless gag website linked from a party invite letter. Entertainment and confusion are the only goals.

## Exemption
This folder is **EXEMPT** from parent `Buisnes/.cursorrules` and root Cursor professionalism / maintainability / “best practices” standards.

- Intentional bad UX, confusing navigation, decoy buttons, cookie spam, and broken flows are required
- AI-slop copy, mismatched fonts, fake ads, and corporate nonsense are the aesthetic
- Harsh, psychedelic, R-rated, Gen Z slang, memes, and cussing are in-scope
- Do **not** “fix” the design to look polished or accessible in a product sense

## Hard limits (still apply)
- No real auth, payments, analytics, or data collection
- No forms that store user data
- No real RSVP / ticket sales — logistics stay in the invite letter
- Static HTML/CSS/JS only; keep it GitHub Pages friendly

## When editing
Prefer more chaos over cleaner code. Match existing gag voice (MORGOTH®, Train Coin®, CANDIDA®, PFDT, ChatGPTxGrok). Leave asset placeholders for logo and party screenshots.
